# Network Validation Notes

This document captures the host-side validation steps used to confirm
successful headless USB networking with an embedded IoT device.

## Tools used
- Windows PowerShell
- ipconfig
- arp
- ping
- ssh

## Validation sequence
1. Confirm USB Ethernet (RNDIS) adapter is UP
2. Verify host IP assignment
3. Discover device via ARP
4. Confirm ICMP reachability
5. Establish SSH access

This mirrors real-world device onboarding in restricted or offline environments.